OL,3,AUK economy grew faster than expected in
OL,4,AJuly
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's economy grew faster than
OL,7,Fexpected in July, latest official
OL,8,Ffigures have shown.
OL,10,FThe economy expanded by 0.4% in the
OL,11,Fmonth, the Office for National
OL,12,FStatistics (ONS) said, whereas
OL,13,Feconomists had predicted no growth.
OL,15,FIt follows growth of 0.3% in June and
OL,16,Fzero growth in May.
OL,18,FThe ONS said expansion in the services,
OL,19,Fproduction and construction sectors had
OL,20,Fcontributed to July's figure.
